Turn off unwanted features enabled by default (from the audit features track,
audit/features-decisions.toml).

- AI: Glic (Gemini in Chrome, actor, contextual cueing), on-device and server
  model execution (OptimizationGuideModelExecution), Skills.
- Privacy Sandbox ad APIs: Topics, Attribution Reporting, the M1 ads APIs
  override (fenced frames for ads). FLEDGE is already off by default; Shared
  Storage and Private Aggregation no longer exist.
- Nags: all in-product help bubbles (the feature_engagement tracker never
  triggers), the default browser prompt and framework, the PDF default viewer
  infobar, the non-milestone update toast, the WebUSB device-connected
  notification.
- Segmentation platform (on-device usage models that drive promos).
